Vegetarian in Japan? Say these 3 words before you order 🥬
Tip: also ask about fish stock, it hides in a lot of soups.

Today's phrases:
• ベジタリアン (bejitarian) = Vegetarian
• にく (niku) = Meat
• ありますか (arimasu ka) = Do you have it?

